## Why This Is Asked

Assesses ability to design a practical, real-time ICA solution with limited microphones, moving sources, and clear performance metrics.

## Key Concepts

- Online whitening with forgetting factor
- Per-bin vs joint diagonalization
- Cross-bin permutation using magnitude and phase cues
- Latency-aware processing

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code for online whitening + ICA
let W = initWhitening();
for each frame:
  x = readFrame();
  xW = W.adapt(x);
  s = ICA.update(xW);
  emit(s);
```

